<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ page_title|default('Judge sign-in — Africa GATES') }}</title>
<meta name="csrf-token" content="{{ csrf_token }}">
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/assets/img/logo-mark.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;0,800;1,600&family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,600;9..40,700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/base/tokens.css') }}">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ asset('/assets/css/components/auth.css') }}">
</head>
<body>
<div class="ag-auth">
  <aside class="ag-auth__brand">
    <div class="ag-auth__orb" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <a class="ag-auth__logo" href="/" aria-label="Africa GATES — home">
      <span class="ag-auth__logo-glyph" aria-hidden="true">G</span>
      <span class="ag-auth__logo-word"><b>Africa</b><span>GATES</span></span>
    </a>
    <div class="ag-auth__pitch">
      <h1>You hold 55%<br>of the score.</h1>
      <p>Your confidential ballot, weighed with the continent's verified votes, decides every Cultural Power Index. Four measures, equally weighed:</p>
      <ul style="margin:18px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none;display:grid;gap:9px">
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font:700 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#ffd24a;width:18px">I</span> Impact — what verifiably changed</li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font:700 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#ffd24a;width:18px">II</span> Originality — a voice the continent hadn't heard</li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font:700 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#ffd24a;width:18px">III</span> Reach — how far the work travelled</li>
        <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:14px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.88)"><span aria-hidden="true" style="font:700 11px/1 'JetBrains Mono',monospace;color:#ffd24a;width:18px">IV</span> Integrity — a record that survives scrutiny</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p class="ag-auth__copy">© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Africa GATES · An Afrovanguard initiative</p>
  </aside>

  <div class="ag-auth__panel">
    <div class="ag-auth__form-wrap">
      <p class="ag-auth__eyebrow">Judges Panel</p>

      {% if not sent %}
        <h1 class="ag-auth__h">Sign in to score</h1>
        <p class="ag-auth__sub">Enter your judge email — we'll send you a 6-digit code.</p>
        {% if error ?? flash_error %}<div class="ag-auth__alert ag-auth__alert--err">{{ error ?? flash_error }}</div>{% endif %}
        <form method="post" action="/judge/login/request">
          <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token }}">
          <div class="ag-auth__field">
            <label class="ag-auth__label" for="email">Judge email</label>
            <input class="ag-auth__input" id="email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@email.com" required autofocus>
          </div>
          <button class="ag-auth__cta" type="submit">Send code →</button>
        </form>
      {% else %}
        <h1 class="ag-auth__h">Check your email</h1>
        <p class="ag-auth__sub">Enter the 6-digit code we just sent. It expires in 15 minutes.</p>
        {% if error ?? flash_error %}<div class="ag-auth__alert ag-auth__alert--err">{{ error ?? flash_error }}</div>{% endif %}
        {% if notice ?? flash_notice %}<div class="ag-auth__alert ag-auth__alert--note">{{ notice ?? flash_notice }}</div>{% endif %}
        <form method="post" action="/judge/login/verify">
          <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token }}">
          <div class="ag-auth__field">
            <label class="ag-auth__label" for="otp">6-digit code</label>
            <input class="ag-auth__input ag-auth__input--otp" id="otp" name="otp" type="text" inputmode="numeric" pattern="[0-9]{6}" maxlength="6" autocomplete="one-time-code" placeholder="······" required autofocus>
          </div>
          <button class="ag-auth__cta" type="submit">Sign in →</button>
        </form>
        <p class="ag-auth__fine">Didn't get a code? <a href="/judge/login">Send again</a></p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
